Disable the auto-updater: packaged builds are updated by the package
manager, and upstream publishes no ppc64le build to update to, so the
startup check fails with "Asset not found". Skip the startup check and
hide Help > Check for Updates, the Updates settings group and the setup
wizard checkbox.

--- a/src/duckstation-qt/interfacesettingswidget.cpp
+++ b/src/duckstation-qt/interfacesettingswidget.cpp
